&lt;p&gt;Sleep is a fundamental practice or part of 24-hours cycle. Where if you don’t get it on consistent basis you are down-regulating your ability to do everything.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;“You should try to get good sleep 80% of the time&amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-practice-getting-natural-light-in-your-eyes-within-one-hour-of-waking-up&#34;&gt;1. Practice getting natural light in your eyes within one hour of waking up&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Try to get 5 to 10 minutes of sunlight. Can sunlight enhance passion? Yes!!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
